ncheng-e-b0a60692cdf5d874567a","title":"曹志居母丧得病，太康九年卒","accounts":[{"id":"rencheng-a-b0a60692cdf5d874567a","label":"裴注引《志别传》","text":"曹志居母丧得病，太康九年卒","evidence":["rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rencheng-p-00bdd6fbfefc3e","role":"居丧得病去世者","evidence":["rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf"]},"ordering_evidence":"rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf","order":3824}],"persons":[{"id":"rencheng-p-00bdd6fbfefc3e","name":"曹志","evidence":["rencheng-q-f147ee4c7b6296524806","rencheng-q-2b4aa05861769300c7b4","rencheng-q-d46f18e8c8be35a7f1d0","rencheng-q-9ec5badc54d6c608dac9","rencheng-q-8959d6d649b4b67d79b0","rencheng-q-444564962a7f9b797986","rencheng-q-34aa4e569680a487a81c","rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf","rencheng-q-7a3f106533bc900b4c5c"],"facts":[{"id":"rencheng-f-3c4268fe7e088a19e14a","text":"字允恭，曹植之子。","evidence":["rencheng-q-7a3f106533bc900b4c5c"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rencheng-q-2b4aa05861769300c7b4","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-df05a5558a99a29a1300","layer":"original","quote":"遗令薄葬。以小子志，保家之主也，欲立之。","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"rencheng-q-34aa4e569680a487a81c","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"后复为散骑常侍。","attribution":"裴注引《志别传》","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":174,"end":182},{"id":"rencheng-q-444564962a7f9b797986","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"及齐王攸当之藩，下礼官，议崇锡之典。志叹曰：‘安有如此之才，如此之亲，而不得树本助化，而远出海隅者乎？’乃建议以谏，辞旨甚切。帝大怒，免志官。","attribution":"裴注引《志别传》","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":103,"end":174},{"id":"rencheng-q-7a3f106533bc900b4c5c","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《志别传》曰：“志字允恭。好学有才行。晋武帝为中抚军，迎常道乡公于邺。志夜与帝相见，帝与语，从暮至旦，甚器之。及受禅，改封鄄城公。发诏以志为乐平太守。历章武、赵郡。迁散骑常侍、国子博士。后转博士祭酒。及齐王攸当之藩，下礼官，议崇锡之典。志叹曰：‘安有如此之才，如此之亲，而不得树本助化，而远出海隅者乎？’乃建议以谏，辞旨甚切。帝大怒，免志官。后复为散骑常侍。志遭母忧，居丧尽哀；因得疾病，喜怒失常。太康九年卒，谥曰定公。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":0,"end":214},{"id":"rencheng-q-8959d6d649b4b67d79b0","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"及受禅，改封鄄城公。发诏以志为乐平太守。历章武、赵郡。迁散骑常侍、国子博士。后转博士祭酒。","attribution":"裴注引《志别传》","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":58,"end":103},{"id":"rencheng-q-9ec5badc54d6c608dac9","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《志别传》曰：“志字允恭。好学有才行。晋武帝为中抚军，迎常道乡公于邺。志夜与帝相见，帝与语，从暮至旦，甚器之。","attribution":"裴注引《志别传》","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":0,"end":58},{"id":"rencheng-q-d46f18e8c8be35a7f1d0","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-df05a5558a99a29a1300","layer":"original","quote":"子志嗣，徙封济北王。","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":60},{"id":"rencheng-q-e34b4cf119570e94ceaf","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2d540a5914acbd2520cf","layer":"pei","quote":"志遭母忧，居丧尽哀；因得疾病，喜怒失常。太康九年卒，谥曰定公。”","attribution":"裴注引《志别传》","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2aa81b6f8e84da968f9","start":182,"end":214},{"id":"rencheng-q-f147ee4c7b6296524806","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-e68d68b64eee4ca85c03","layer":"original","quote":"志累增邑，并前九百九十户〖10〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":446,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
